stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending : Strategy run or agent cycle
  pending --> awaiting_approval : submit (auto_submit=true or manual)
  awaiting_approval --> approved : human approves
  awaiting_approval --> rejected : human rejects
  approved --> executed : risk check passes, order placed
  approved --> cancelled : human cancels before execution
  executed --> [*]
  rejected --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]

  note right of awaiting_approval
    Agent-generated signals
    enter here directly
    (signal_kind=alert)
  end note

  note right of executed
    Order record created,
    broker order submitted,
    audit event written
  end note
